OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's media treatment
OL,4,Aechoes what happened to Diana, Earl
OL,5,ASpencer tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the BBC reported on
OL,8,FFriday how Earl Spencer says he was
OL,9,F"telling the truth" when he claimed
OL,10,FKing Charles said people would forget
OL,11,FDiana "soon enough" in a phone call in
OL,12,Fthe days after her death.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
