OL,3,AMajor seaside hotel fire treated as
OL,4,Asuspicious
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire at a seaside hotel where about
OL,7,F280 people were evacuated is believed
OL,8,Fto have been caused deliberately,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FA total of 26 fire engines were sent to
OL,12,Fthe Grand Burstin Hotel in Folkestone
OL,13,Fat about 01:05 BST on Saturday, Kent
OL,14,FFire & Rescue Service said.
OL,16,FKent Police said that the fire was
OL,17,Fbeing treated as suspicious and is
OL,18,Fappealing for witnesses.
OL,20,F"Inquiries into the circumstances are
OL,21,Funder way," police said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
