OL,3,AGerman elections under way which could
OL,4,Adecide fate of Chancellor Merz
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal elections are taking place in two
OL,7,FGerman states on Sunday which could
OL,8,Fincrease the political pressure on
OL,9,FChancellor Friedrich Merz.
OL,11,FOpinion polls in Berlin and
OL,12,FMecklenburg-Vorpommerm suggest Merz's
OL,13,FChristian Democratic Union (CDU) is at
OL,14,Frisk of damaging defeats, which would
OL,15,Fraise further questions about the
OL,16,Fchancellor's future.
OL,18,FThese latest elections come after the
OL,19,Ffar-right Alternative for Germany (AfD)
OL,20,Fparty won a major victory in the state
OL,21,Fof Saxony-Anhalt two weeks ago, while
OL,22,Fthe CDU saw its vote halved.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
